  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RDC Youth Skills Training, Job Creation and Employment in Kismayo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Skill training, job creation and employment in Kismayo project targets 200(55% female) unemployed youth. The duration of the project will be 24 months and the objective is to enable young men and women to become self-dependent by improving their skills, access to employment and assisting them in establishing their own businesses in Kismayo. The project will provide Masonry with painting, fishery, cooking &amp; Auxiliary Nurse/Midwifery</narrative>
  </description>
